Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个秋天的星期二早晨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One Tuesday morning in autumn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}八点半整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at precisely half past eight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯收到了一条神秘字条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes received a mysterious message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位身世显赫的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that two men of great public distinction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在完全保密的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be visiting Baker's Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.78,0:01:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in their private capacity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乘坐他们的私人马车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and under circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正赶往贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of complete secrecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:44.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《第二块血迹》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 他们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, they're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简短的说 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In brief, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一份文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A document has been stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我的私人公文箱中被偷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from my private dispatch box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我发现了失窃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when I discovered my loss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已是今天早晨八点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which was at eight o'clock this morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我立即报告了首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I at once informed the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据他的建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was at his suggestion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们俩来找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we both come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们已经报警了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have informed the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有先生 我们还没有那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir, we have not done so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且我们也不可能那样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor is it possible that we should do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从长远角度来看 让警方知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To inform the police must, in the long run, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意味着公诸于众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mean to inform the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is what we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}极其要避免的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}particularly desire to avoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那文件在一定程度上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the document in question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是如此的重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is of such immense importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以至于它的发表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that its publication might very easily, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might almost say probably, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很容易导致{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lead to European complications{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欧洲的极度混乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the utmost moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追回文件一事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless its recovery is attended{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须绝对保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the utmost secrecy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则也就毫无必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then it may as well not be recovered at all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为盗窃文件的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all that is aimed at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是为了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by those who have taken it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that its contents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文件的内容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should be generally known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:04:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 催罗尼·侯普先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Mr. Trelawney Hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您能告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be much obliged if you would tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这文件丢失时的确切情形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the exact circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将不胜感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under which this document disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为欧洲事务大臣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Secretary of State for European affairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在六天前收到了一封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I received the letter six days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是一位外国君主寄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a letter from the foreign potentate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was of such importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不敢把它放在我的保险柜中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I never left it in my safe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是每天从办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I have taken each evening from my office, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带回到我在白厅住宅街的家中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to my house in Whitehall Terrace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.00,0:04:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且把它放在我的卧室中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kept it in my bedroom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}锁在文件箱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}locked in my dispatch box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定昨晚它是在里面吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are sure it was there last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm quite certain of that fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上我打开了文件箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually opened the dispatch box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我晚饭前穿衣时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I was dressing for dinner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到文件在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I saw the letter inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后它一直在我旁边的桌子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It then remained upon my bedside table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和我妻子睡觉都很轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both my wife and I are light sleepers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且发誓肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and are prepared to swear that no one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚没人进入房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have entered the room during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而今早那文件却不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet this morning the paper is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么时候吃的晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time did you dine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}七点半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven-thirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过了多长时间你去睡觉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long was it before you went to bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子去看戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife had gone to the theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直坐在外屋等她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had waited up for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:05:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到十一点半我们才回屋睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was eleven-thirty before we went our room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么在四个小时中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So for four hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文件箱是没人看管的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the dispatch box had lain unguarded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 从没人被允许进那屋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, no one is ever permitted to enter that room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了女仆早晨去过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}save the housemaid in the morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我的仆人其他时间去过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my valet during the rest of the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是值得信任的仆人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are both trusty servants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们工作了很多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who have been with us for many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不可能知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neither of them could have possibly known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我的箱子中有比一般文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there was anything more valuable than the ordinary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都贵重的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}departmental papers in my box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确信你的妻子知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely your wife knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have long known how high{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侯普先生有很强的社会责任感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Hope's sense of public duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信在这件重要的事中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am convinced that in the case of this importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信件的保密工作会重于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would rise superior to the most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家庭感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}intimate domestic ties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承蒙您过奖了 首相先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do me no more than justice, Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到今早我都未向妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until this morning I have never breathed one word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提起过这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my wife upon this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在英格兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is there in England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁还知道这封信的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who did know the existence of this letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天通知了各位内阁大臣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each member of the Cabinet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有这样一封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was informed of it yesterday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天内阁会议都会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the pledge of secrecy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强调保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which attends every Cabinet meeting, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was increased by the solemn warning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}郑重地提醒了大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given by the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一想到几个小时中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to think that within a few hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就弄丢了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself should have lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了内阁成员们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides the members of the Cabinet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有两人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are two, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能有三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}possibly three, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}官员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}departmental officials{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道这信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who know of the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以保证在英国再没其他人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one else in England, I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国外呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But abroad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信国外没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that no one abroad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看过这信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has seen the letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了写信的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except the man who wrote it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深信写信的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am well convinced that his ministers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有通过一般官方的渠道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the usual official channels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来处理这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have not been employed in this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 先生 我不得不问一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, sir, I must ask you more particularly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那文件是关于什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what this document is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且它为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and why its disappearance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会引起严重的后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should have such momentous consequences?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那信封薄而长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the envelope is a long, thin one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是浅灰色的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of pale blue color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用红蜡封着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a seal of red wax{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}印有蹲着的狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stamped with a crouching lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收信人的地址是黑色的手写体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is addressed in large, bold handwriting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting and indeed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些细节同样重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}essential as these details are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须知道更根源的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my inquiries must go more to the root of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是封怎样的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是政府的最高机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a State secret of the utmost importance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which we cannot tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且我看那也不必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor do I see that it is necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能通过你的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If by the powers which you are said to possess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到我描述的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can find such an envelope as I describe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连同它的附件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with its enclosure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将得到国家的奖赏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you will have deserved well of your country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时得到我们权限内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and earned any reward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何的报酬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which it is within our power to bestow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是这个国家中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are two of the most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最忙碌的两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}busy men in the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这个小侦探也很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in my own small way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多人来找我帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a good many calls upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.61,0:07:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很遗憾在这件事上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret exceedingly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没办法帮你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am unable to help you in this matter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在目前的情形下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and any continuation of this interview{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次见面是在浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be a waste of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从没人这样对我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not accustomed sir to such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须得接受你的要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must accept your terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问你是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you are right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有完全信任你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it is unreasonable for us to expect you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你才能展开工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to act unless you have our full confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意你 首相先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree with you, Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我将告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}relying entirely upon your honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和你的同事 华生先生的荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that of your colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也信任你们有强烈的爱国心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must appeal to your patriotism also, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不敢想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I cannot imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦事情暴露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a greater misfortune for this country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的国家将遭受多么大的灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than that this affair should come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以放心地信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may safely trust us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The letter, then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自一位外国君主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is from a certain foreign potentate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对我国殖民地的迅速发展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has been ruffled by some recent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感到愤慨从而写了这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}colonial developments of this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信是匆匆写成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is written hurriedly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}且完全出于他个人的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and upon his own responsibility entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于此同时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the same time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这封信写得很不合体统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is couched in so unfortunate a manner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的发表无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that its publication would undoubtedly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会激怒英国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lead to the most dangerous feeling in this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会引起轩然大波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There would be such ferment, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I do not hesitate to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这封信如果发表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that within a week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一个星期内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the publication of this letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个国家将卷进战争中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this country would be involved in a great war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is this letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将意味着花费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which may well mean the expenditure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几亿英镑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a thousand million pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和几十万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人民的牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a hundred thousand men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你通知写信的人了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you informed the sender?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经发了密码电报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cipher telegraph has been dispatched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许他希望信被发表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps he desires the publication of the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 医生 我们有足够的理由相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Doctor, we have strong reason to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经感到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he already understands that he has{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己的急躁与不谨慎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acted in an indiscreet and hotheaded manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果信被发表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be a far greater blow to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他自己国家的打击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his country than to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比对英国的大得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if this letter were to come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这样的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公布这信将符合哪些人的利益呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in who's interest is it that the letter should come out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么有人会盗窃并发表这封信呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should anyone desire to steal it or publish it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样的话 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, Doctor Watson, you take me into the realms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就牵扯到紧张的国际关系了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of high international politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.49,0:10:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你考虑一下目前欧洲的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you consider the European situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就不难看出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will have no difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中真正的动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in perceiving the motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个欧洲是个武装起来的堡垒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole of Europe is an armed camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大不列颠保持中立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Britain holds the scales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果英国被迫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Britain were driven into war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与哪个联盟交战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with one confederacy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必定会使另一个联盟获利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would assure the supremacy of the other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.69,0:10:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论它们是否参与战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether they were joined in the war or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么是否是这位君主的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does the enemies of this potentate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要得到并发表这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who want to secure and publish this letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来分裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so as to make a breach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的国家和我国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between his country and ours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:10:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这信落入敌人手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to whom would the document be sent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将把它交给谁呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it fell into the wrong hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给欧洲任何一个国家的一个大臣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To any of the great chancelleries of Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许目前持信的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is probably speeding its way thither{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正乘火车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the present instant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火速前往目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as fast as steam can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友 那是你的不幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your misfortune, my dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁都不能责怪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有疏忽大意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no precaution which you have neglected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是现在 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情你全了解了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are in full possession of the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What course do you recommend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为找不到这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that if this document is not recovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会发生战争吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there will be war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得很有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it is very probable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.31,0:11:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 先生 请准备打仗吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, sir, prepare for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 很难说找不回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a hard saying, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考虑现实情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以想象那文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems no doubt this document was taken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在七点半到十一点半之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between half past seven{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已被拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and half past eleven yesterday evening, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么它现在会在哪呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so where can it be now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁也没有理由扣押这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has any reason to retain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它已很快地被{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been passed from hand to hand rapidly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交到需要它的人手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to those who need it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或以高价买它的人手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who will pay well for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能有什么机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What chance do we have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到它或弄清它在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to overtake it or even trace it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这超出我的能力范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is beyond our reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你说的完全符合逻辑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you say is perfectly logical, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到我们确实无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel that the matter is indeed out of our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 侯普{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, Hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不要因为这件不幸的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we cannot ignore all our other duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而忽略了其他职责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on account of this one misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天如果有新的进展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should there be any fresh developments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during the day we will communicate with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也务必让我们了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you no doubt will let us know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你调查的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the results of your own inquiries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telegraph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维斯特敏斯特谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Westminster Murder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维斯特敏斯特谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Westminster Murder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telegraph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维斯特敏斯特谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Westminster Murder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Telegraph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情形令人绝望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The situation is desperate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不是完全没有希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are only three men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敢冒这么大危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}capable of playing so bold a game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥波尔斯坦 拉若泽和艾秋阿多·卢卡斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oberstein, La Rothiere, and Eduardo Lucas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至是现在 如果我们知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now, if we could be sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁拿了信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which one of them has taken it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可能的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is just possible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还没有把信出手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it has not passed out of their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是钱的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a question of money with these fellows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有英国财政部的支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we have the British Treasure behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他肯出价 我就会买下它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh if it's on the market I'll buy it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管花多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it means another penny on the income tax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰你了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 有什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔达·崔洛尼·侯普小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Hilda Trelawney Hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请她进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}show her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我丈夫来过这儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has my husband been here, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 女士 他来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam, yes he has been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I implore you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要告诉他我来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to tell him I came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ladyship puts me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您令我很为难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a very delicate position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg of you to sit down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并告诉我您有什么请求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell me what it is you desire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不能无条件地答应您一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I cannot make you any unconditional promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我将对您开诚布公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, I will speak frankly to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时期望那将{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the hope that it will induce you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使您对我也能坦率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to speak frankly in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和我丈夫在任何事情上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is complete confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都完全地互相信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between my husband and myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on all matters except one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是政治问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one is politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这方面他总是守口如瓶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this his lips are sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从不告诉我任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tells me nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I am aware that there was a most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.59,0:15:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚我们家发生了一件很不幸的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deplorable occurrence in our house last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道一份文件丢失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that a paper has disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.91,0:15:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是事关政治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But because the matter is political{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丈夫并没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my husband refuses to take me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我完全讲清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into his complete confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事情非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it is essential{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}essential, I say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该彻底了解这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I should thoroughly understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了几位政治家之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the only people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是唯一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}save these politicians, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了解情况的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who know the true facts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少我推测是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at least I presume you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你推测得没错 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You presume correctly, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell me exactly what has happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会导致什么结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what it may lead to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请详细告诉我 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me all, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要因为怕损失我丈夫的利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let no regard for my husband's interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不肯告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keep you silent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他早晚会明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that his interests, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为只有完全相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he would only see it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be best served by taking me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才能有所保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into his complete confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么文件被偷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was this paper, which was stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您所问的是不能说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam, what you ask me is really impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要明白我只能这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must see that this so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您丈夫认为不该让您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your husband thinks fit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep you in the dark over this matter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it for me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于职业的缘故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has only learned the true facts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才知道的全部真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the pledge of professional secrecy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能随便说出来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell what he has withheld?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不应该问起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not fair to ask it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须问他本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is he who you must ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问过他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have asked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是万不得已才来问您的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come to you as a last resort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您既然不肯告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But without your telling me anything definite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能帮我一个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may do me a great service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我一点启发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you would enlighten me on one point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启发是指什么 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, madam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丈夫的政治生涯是否会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is my husband's political career{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这件事受到影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}likely to suffer through this incident?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非事情处理得当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well let me say if it is not put right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则后果非常严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it may have a very unfortunate effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个问题 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more question, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我丈夫对此事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From an expression which my husband dropped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一显出惊奇开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the first shock of the disaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就明白因为文件的丢失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understood that terrible public consequences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会在社会上引起一系列影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might arise from the loss this document.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他这么说 我不能否定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he said so, I cannot deny it.{\r}
