Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您所问的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you ask me more{\r}
