Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就不耽误您的时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will waste no more of your time.{\r}
