Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们只知道在高德尔芬街看到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know all they see at Godolphin Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们肯定不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know, and shall know nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白厅住宅街的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Whitehall Terrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有我们全知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only we know of both events, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并可以弄清两者之间的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can trace the relation between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:21:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is with the late Eduardo Lucas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和艾秋阿多·卢卡斯有直接关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the solution to our problem lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情还没发生就得出结论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is a capital mistake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个极大的错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to theorize in advance of the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你值班接待客人 我的好华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay here my good, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽量回来和你一起吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will join you when I'm able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 他们逮捕了仆人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, they've arrested the valet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.28,0:22:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德负责这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrade has been put in charge of the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他像个苍蝇一样到处嗡嗡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's buzzing around like a blue bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该认识到这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to know him rather well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.50,0:22:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我去和他谈会有帮助吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it help if I spoke to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不会有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no it would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a case where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察对我们来说和对罪犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the law is as dangerous to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.82,0:22:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一样危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the criminals are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须耐心等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be patient and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas murder case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:03.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《标准晚报》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Evening Standard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas murder case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.60,0:23:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫌疑人被释放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.08,0:23:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murder case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.41,0:23:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫌疑人被释放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:21.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《标准晚报》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Evening Standard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas murder case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早餐 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breakfast, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.34,0:24:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 谢谢 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, No thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道怎么说 你再这样下去会晕倒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. You'll fade away at this rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 他们找到凶手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, Holmes, they've found the murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.79,0:24:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者说是女凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or rather the murderess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.77,0:24:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有条巴黎来的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a wire from Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显卢卡斯有着双重身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently Lucas was leading a double life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在法国有个太太是克里奥尔人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a Creole wife in France{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在那里自称亨利·弗那依{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he called himself Henri Fournaye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.33,0:24:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的几名仆人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman was reported to the police yesterday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.21,0:24:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向警察报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by her servants, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.25,0:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说她已经精神失常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she is quite insane, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.81,0:24:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 患有危险的长期狂躁症 - 可怜的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- a mania of a dangerous and permanent form. - Poor woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一名容貌酷似她的妇女在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same woman was seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀当晚在高德尔芬街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the neighborhood of Godolphin Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.85,0:24:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被人看到过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the night of the murder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.20,0:24:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后又在查林十字车站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and later made an emotional scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因举止狂暴被人注意到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Charing Cross Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.54,0:24:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what do you think of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my dear Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真能忍啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are so long-suffering, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去几天我什么都没给你讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I've told you nothing over these last few days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为没什么可说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is because there is nothing to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.31,0:25:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在从巴黎来的这个消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now this report from Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.66,0:25:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样没什么帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't help us much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和卢卡斯的死总还有关系吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well surely it's final as regards to Lucas' death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的死只是个意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's death is a mere incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.07,0:25:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我们的真正目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a trivial episode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻找丢失文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in comparison with our real task, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.41,0:25:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}避免欧洲的一场灾难相比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is to trace the document{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是小事一件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and save a European catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.21,0:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这封信丢失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if the letter were loose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.38,0:25:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不可能丢失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no, it cannot be loose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.83,0:25:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果没丢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if it isn't loose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信又在哪呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.23,0:25:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁拿着这封信呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要扣押这封信呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it held back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.73,0:25:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果雷斯垂德在卢卡斯的文件中找到了信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look if Lestrade found it amongst Lucas' papers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.86,0:25:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会傻到向公众公开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's not such a fool as to announce it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会通报局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would inform the chief commissioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.39,0:25:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chief commissioner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.23,0:25:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会通报给内政大臣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would inform the Home Secretary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.48,0:25:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内政大臣最后会告诉首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he, in turn, the Prime Minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是在卢卡斯的文件中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it's not among Lucas' papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但为什么被扣押了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why is it held back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.87,0:25:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是问题所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.91,0:25:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像是一把锤头敲击着我的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which beats in my brain like a hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.23,0:26:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯被杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it a mere coincidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是信丢失的那晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Lucas should meet his death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.09,0:26:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会是巧合吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the night when the letter disappeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他拿到信了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it ever reach him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她那位疯太太会不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has this mad wife of his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.46,0:26:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着信回了巴黎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taken it with her to Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.71,0:26:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是这样 会不会是在她巴黎的家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If so, is it in her house in Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.47,0:26:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我去巴黎吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I go to Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那会惊动巴黎警方的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would alert the French Police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.43,0:26:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人人都在和我们作对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every man's hand is against us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而偏偏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.15,0:26:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情又很重大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the interest at stake are colossal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我能顺利解决这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I bring this to a successful conclusion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.52,0:26:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那无疑将是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will certainly represent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我事业生涯最大的光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the crowning glory of my career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.28,0:26:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.41,0:27:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.37,0:27:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给您 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go gov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们毫无疑问也在调查卢卡斯的案子吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no doubt been following the Lucas case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.26,0:27:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.82,0:27:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 名字倒是挺熟悉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe yes, the name does seem familiar to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.33,0:27:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾秋阿多·卢卡斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eduardo Lucas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.10,0:27:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被发现上周二晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found murdered last Tuesday night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.77,0:27:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在高德尔芬的家中被谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at his house in Godolphin Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.33,0:27:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位不同寻常的先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rather a distinguished gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.21,0:27:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国际政治学学生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Student of international politics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.78,0:27:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有名的语言学家 他们是这样说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a remarkable linguist, so they say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.39,0:27:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上是我负责这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been in charge of the case, matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是个轻松的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not an easy task by any means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.81,0:27:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一些很棘手的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some delicate problems you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.36,0:27:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在法国同仁的帮助下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to the aid of our French friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.92,0:27:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会令人满意地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be able to bring the case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.07,0:27:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解决这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a satisfactory conclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有线索又联系了起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the loose ends tied up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.35,0:28:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们弄清楚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh we've got it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.60,0:28:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像亲眼看到一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}clear as if we'd seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.96,0:28:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜你 雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你事业上又一笔功绩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another feather in your cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.71,0:28:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你走之前 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh before you go, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.08,0:28:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一件小事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a mere trifle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.02,0:28:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你感兴趣的那类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the sort of thing you take an interest in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.31,0:28:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怪事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}queer, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.15,0:28:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能称之为诡异{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you might call freakish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和主要事实没有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has nothing to do with the main fact, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.22,0:28:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须亲眼看到才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can't have, on the face of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well if you gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.60,0:28:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿意来高德尔芬街一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could come down to Godolphin Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.16,0:28:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想在现场解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I could explain it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会比较清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}better on the spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.40,0:28:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能就几分钟吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a few minutes perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.07,0:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 就在拐角那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh good, it's only just around the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.14,0:28:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 车夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Cabbie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.54,0:28:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用找钱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keep the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.70,0:29:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it all is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.79,0:29:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女人看到仆人走了之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the woman must have knocked on the door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她去敲了门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after she saw the valet had gone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.06,0:29:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问是出乎意料的拜访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise visit no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.57,0:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯让她进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas let her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不能让自己的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't keep her on the street could he, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留在街上 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his own wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.16,0:29:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她用法语冲他大喊大叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She started screaming at him being French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.93,0:29:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}借过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.98,0:29:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说她如何跟踪他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saying how'd she traced him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后训斥他等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and reproaching him and so on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们来到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway they came in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情总是互相影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one thing led to another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.84,0:29:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}匕首就在手边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and with the daggers being so handy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.97,0:29:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后的事情发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the end came soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.85,0:29:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是立即死亡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't happen in an instant though{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}椅子全倒在墙边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for these chairs were swept over to the wall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他手里还抓着一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he had this one in his hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.01,0:29:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎他想用椅子挡开匕首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as if he did try to hold her off with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 雷斯垂德 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes Lestrade, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.02,0:29:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我有什么怪事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now tell me about this trifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.73,0:29:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这类犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know in crimes of this sort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.29,0:29:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会保持现场原状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we keep things in their position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.17,0:29:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不准动任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing has moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.22,0:29:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派人日夜看守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officers in charge day and night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.99,0:29:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很主意这点的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always very particular on that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.87,0:29:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的调查总是严谨细微 警探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're meticulous in your investigations, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.89,0:29:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早 我们想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well this morning we thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.15,0:30:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该可以收拾一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could tidy up a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.40,0:30:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸检进行完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Post-mortem over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.44,0:30:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证据搜集完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the evidence gathered, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.01,0:30:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}investigation complete, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.61,0:30:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 这块地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}however, this carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.54,0:30:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它并没有固定在地板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see it's not been fastened down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.77,0:30:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是摆在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's just been laid there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.23,0:30:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们碰巧掀了一下地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we had occasion to raise it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.67,0:30:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.18,0:30:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.95,0:30:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一百年也猜不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never guess in a hundred years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.25,0:30:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们发现了什么 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we did find, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.54,0:30:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见这块血迹了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you see this stain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.32,0:30:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分的血迹已经浸透了地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now a good deal of blood must have soaked through, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.76,0:30:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undoubtedly it must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.85,0:30:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们听到我说在背面相应的地板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll be surprised to hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.45,0:30:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却没有血迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there is no stain on the woodwork{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.11,0:30:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定感到奇怪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to correspond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有血迹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No stain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.37,0:30:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可这绝对不可能啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管你说一定有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you would say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fact remains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.84,0:30:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:31:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地毯上面和下面有同样的血迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the under side is as stained as the upper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.23,0:31:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定会留下痕迹的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have left a mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来解开谜底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I will show you the explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有第二块血迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a second stain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.89,0:31:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是和第一块位置不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it does not correspond with this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.54,0:31:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.37,0:31:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能拿起地毯的另一边吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will you take that side of the carpet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.07,0:31:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们转过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we will move round{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.63,0:31:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按照顺时针方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in an empty clockwise direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.81,0:31:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I want to know is, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.84,0:31:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁转动了地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who shifted the carpet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.07,0:31:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及转动它的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.25,0:31:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德 谋杀第二天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrade, who was on duty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.81,0:31:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里谁负责看守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the day after the murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.84,0:31:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.82,0:32:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克弗逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MacPherson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.07,0:32:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's out there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.37,0:32:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好审问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Examine him carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.51,0:32:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.66,0:32:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别当着我们的面问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it before us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.58,0:32:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这里等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他你知道有人进来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him you know someone has been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.16,0:32:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他施压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.31,0:32:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他只有坦白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him a full confession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.45,0:32:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才能绕他不死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is his only chance of forgiveness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找我说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do exactly as I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 如果他知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By George, if he knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.15,0:32:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要问出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have it out of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.57,0:32:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 去望风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, quick get the table!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.55,0:33:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here, Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.83,0:33:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克弗逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MacPherson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.91,0:33:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家里人怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.58,0:33:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.25,0:33:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 快说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well come out with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.30,0:33:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让先生们听听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let these gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不可饶恕的罪行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hear of your inexcusable conduct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无疑冒犯 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I meant no harm sir, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位年轻女士来到门前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This young woman came to the door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.33,0:33:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来应聘一个打字员的广告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}answering an advertisement about typewriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说找错房子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was mistook, the house she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.17,0:33:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正当我们说话时 先生 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While we were talking, sir, you know how it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:33:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人在外面看守一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit lonely when you're out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:33:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难免有些寂寞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on duty all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.75,0:34:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么 麦克弗逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened, MacPherson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.15,0:34:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我们说到了这场谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sir, we got talking about the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.23,0:34:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说她在报纸上读到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had read about it in the paper, she said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想看看案发现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wanted to see where it was done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.41,0:34:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得让她看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I saw no harm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.45,0:34:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么大碍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in letting her have a weak peep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她走到大概门那个位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got just about in the door there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.04,0:34:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了地毯上的血迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spotted that mark in the carpet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.50,0:34:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后晕倒在地板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and down she dropped on the floor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟死了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lay for dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.69,0:34:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.76,0:34:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续 麦克弗逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, MacPherson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.95,0:34:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就到拐角的常春藤商店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well sir, I was away around at the lvy Plant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}买了点白兰地 等我拿酒回来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some brandy, and by the time I had brought it back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.33,0:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位年轻女士…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the young woman had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well she wasn't here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是她醒了过来自己离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had recovered and was off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.26,0:34:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她感到不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashamed of herself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愿意再见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dared not face me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克弗逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MacPherson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你动过地毯吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you move the carpet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.51,0:34:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是把地毯摆好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir, I only straightened it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她倒在地毯上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see she had fell on it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.27,0:34:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而地板又光又滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the polished floor being slippery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.63,0:34:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住这个教训 警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let that be a lesson to you, Constable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.30,0:34:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你骗不了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you can't deceive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定以为你的失职{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt that you thought your breach of duty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.37,0:35:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会被发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would never be discovered, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.93,0:35:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我一看地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet a mere glance at that carpet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就马上知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was enough to convince me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.75,0:35:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人到屋子里来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that someone had been admitted to this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky for you, my man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没丢什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that nothing's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.55,0:35:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然你少不了吃苦头的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise you would find yourself in Queer Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.99,0:35:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.12,0:35:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我们还在这儿干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, what are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在别的地方还有事呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have work elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你事业上又一笔功绩 雷斯垂德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another feather in your cap, Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.55,0:35:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.86,0:35:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Lord, Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.63,0:35:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.85,0:35:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解决了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you solved it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.10,0:35:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快了 华生 就快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly, Watson, hardly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.42,0:36:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有两位先生想见您 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two gentlemen wish to speak to you, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.86,0:36:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没有预约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do not have an appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.84,0:36:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是谁 贝茨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they, Bates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.41,0:36:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.91,0:36:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有华生医生 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a Doctor Watson, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.11,0:36:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.05,0:36:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带他们进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may show them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.09,0:36:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.43,0:36:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.19,0:36:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生和华生医生 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes and Doctor Watson, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.33,0:36:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你实在太不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is surely most unfair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.89,0:37:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太不宽厚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ungenerous on your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.08,0:37:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我解释过了 我希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have desired, as I have explained, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.17,0:37:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去找你的事要保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep my visit to you a secret{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.84,0:37:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你却到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet you compromise me by coming here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.82,0:37:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}借此表明你和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so showing that there are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有事务联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}business relations between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.01,0:37:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸地是 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, madam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.16,0:37:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有别的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no possible alternative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.19,0:37:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受托找回这件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been commissioned to recover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.65,0:37:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}极其重要的文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an immensely important document.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.03,0:37:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能请求您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must ask you, therefore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.07,0:37:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能好心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be kind enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它交给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to place it in my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.65,0:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这是在侮辱我 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You insult me, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.15,0:37:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必摇铃 希尔达夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not ring, Lady Hilda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你合作 我会安排好一切的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you work with me I can arrange everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.53,0:37:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you work against me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.51,0:37:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就要揭发你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must expose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要吓唬我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to frighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.38,0:37:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来到这里威胁一位女性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a very manly thing, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.37,0:37:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是大丈夫的行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come here and browbeat a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.79,0:37:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你了解了一些情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you have something to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.15,0:37:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 我给你五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, I give you five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.82,0:37:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一分钟就够了 希尔达夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One is enough, Lady Hilda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:38:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你去过艾秋阿多·卢卡斯那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know of your visit to Eduardo Lucas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.45,0:38:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给了他这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of your giving him this letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.22,0:38:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道你又巧妙地去过那间房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of your ingenious return to the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在谋杀后第二天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the evening after the murder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还知道你怎么样从地毯下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and of the manner in which you took this letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.38,0:38:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隐蔽的地方取走了这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from it's hiding place under the carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.87,0:38:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直带着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have kept this because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我想也许有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it might be useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个警察认出了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The policeman recognized you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再说一次 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once again, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 你疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you you're under some absurd illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.97,0:38:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 希尔达女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I am so sorry, Lady Hilda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.85,0:38:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have done my best, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.77,0:38:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我感觉都白费了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I feel that I'm in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}崔洛·尼侯普先生在家吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Mr. Trelawney Hope at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.59,0:38:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他十二点半回来 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be back at half past twelve, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.85,0:38:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一刻钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have a quarter of an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.24,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就在这里等他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.52,0:39:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}饶恕我吧 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, spare me, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.98,0:39:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}饶了我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.86,0:39:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 别告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For heaven's sake don't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.99,0:39:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是那么爱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.14,0:39:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不愿意给他的生活带来不快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not bring one shadow on his life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.22,0:39:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这会让他伤透了心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this I know would break his noble heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.41,0:39:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们时间紧迫啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have not an instant to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.77,0:39:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.37,0:39:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓我没看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to heaven I'd never seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.19,0:40:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文件箱呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the dispatch box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.44,0:40:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我丈夫那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.27,0:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他总是随身携带的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever he goes he takes it with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.61,0:40:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只有几分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only have a few minutes left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.07,0:40:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔达夫人 我费了很大力气保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Lady Hilda, I'm going far to screen you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.53,0:40:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.31,0:40:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得坦白地告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will spend the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.66,0:40:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干这些不同寻常的事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}telling me frankly the real meaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.91,0:40:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of this extraordinary affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.26,0:40:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天下午{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was on the afternoon of that day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怕的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that terrible day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.69,0:40:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾秋阿多卢卡被杀的那天？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day Eduardo Lucas was murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.71,0:40:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正准备出去应酬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just going out to pay some calls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.69,0:40:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一封机密的信寄来给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a confidential note arrived for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.30,0:40:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是卢卡斯寄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was from Lucas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.29,0:40:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我立即去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}asking me to visit him urgently, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.48,0:40:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有一些重要并私密的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as he had important and private information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能对我讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my ears alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.93,0:41:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他通过某种手段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had obtained, in some way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.06,0:41:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弄到了我的一封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a letter of mine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.42,0:41:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在我婚前写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An indiscreet letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.24,0:41:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一封不慎重的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}written before my marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.43,0:41:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愚蠢的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foolish letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.31,0:41:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一封感情冲动陷入恋爱的女孩子写的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letter of an impulsive, loving girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.50,0:41:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有恶意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant no harm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.38,0:41:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我丈夫会认为这是犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet my husband would have thought it criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是他读了这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had he read that letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.38,0:41:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他便再也不会信任我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his confidence would have been forever destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.78,0:41:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是很多年前写的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's years since I wrote it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.14,0:41:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为这件事就这样过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the whole matter was forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.82,0:42:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问你写得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you remember to content very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.51,0:42:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很轻薄 我得说很轻薄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very sprightly, I must say, very sprightly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.85,0:42:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的回答很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make a charming correspondent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.00,0:42:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想从我得这里到什么 卢卡斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want with me, Mr. Lucas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.40,0:42:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能要回我的信吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have my letter back please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.90,0:42:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 希尔达夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you may, Lady Hilda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.93,0:42:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这张纸可是很值钱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is a very valuable piece of paper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.75,0:42:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不这么想吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you not agree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.41,0:42:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定如果把它放在你丈夫面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure if it was laid before your husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.81,0:42:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可不会喜欢这些内容的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would hardly fail to appreciate the content.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.78,0:42:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个敲诈犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a blackmailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.24,0:42:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一位商人 希尔达夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A businessman, Lady Hilda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.43,0:42:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对我来说只是一笔交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is purely a business transaction on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.25,0:42:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证我不希望看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you I wish no ill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.33,0:42:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你丈夫不和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to you or your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.32,0:42:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much money do you want for that letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.09,0:42:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Lucas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.60,0:42:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要提钱 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not speak of money, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.16,0:42:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的生意没那么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My business is not so simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.78,0:42:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱很容易弄到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the matter is an easy one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.91,0:43:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你丈夫从部里回来的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when your husband returns from his ministry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.91,0:43:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他都会带着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he brings with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.96,0:43:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的私人文件箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his private dispatch box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.19,0:43:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that not so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.07,0:43:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.95,0:43:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他今晚回家时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he comes home tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.62,0:43:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}箱子里会有一封{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this box will contain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.18,0:43:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长的蓝色的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a long, blue envelope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.85,0:43:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用红蜡封着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sealed in red wax{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.63,0:43:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面是一只蹲着的狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a crouching lion stamped on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.38,0:43:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把那封蓝信带给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me that long, blue envelope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.68,0:43:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连皮带瓤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with its contents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.39,0:43:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就会还给你这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will return you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.27,0:43:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我丈夫呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.98,0:43:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会受到伤害的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No harm will come to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.13,0:43:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.57,0:43:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换到我的立场想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put yourselves in my position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.76,0:43:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was I to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.37,0:43:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}选择丈夫的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your husband into your confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能 华生医生 我不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not, Doctor Watson, I could not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.26,0:43:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一方面会导致幸福的毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the one side seemed certain ruin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.39,0:43:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面是件可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the other, terrible as it seemed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.89,0:44:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我去偷丈夫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take my husband's paper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.35,0:44:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的政治文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a matter of politics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.40,0:44:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}政治方面我反正不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.38,0:44:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而爱和信任的重要性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While in the matter of love and trust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.15,0:44:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是十分理解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was only too clear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.08,0:44:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我干的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.17,0:44:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.25,0:44:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我编造了去剧院的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I invented a story about going to the theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.86,0:46:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早晨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.70,0:46:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现我只是用新麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realized I'd only exchanged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.95,0:46:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代替了旧烦恼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one trouble for another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.45,0:47:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟踪丈夫来到贝克街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed my husband to Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后一个人来见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then came to you myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.27,0:47:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了弄明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.31,0:47:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事的后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the full enormity of the offence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是唯一知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I alone in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.28,0:47:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文件下落的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knew where the paper was hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.37,0:47:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只有一个想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole mind was turned to the one thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.24,0:47:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是把它拿回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of getting it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.17,0:47:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I did, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.46,0:47:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here he is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.65,0:47:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么消息 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any news Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有希望了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some hopes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.08,0:47:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事事关政治 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a matter of politics, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.75,0:47:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间不会太长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall not be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.84,0:47:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首相和我们一起用午餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister is lunching with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.82,0:47:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以来听听吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May he share your hopes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.18,0:47:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他意志刚强 据我所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has nerves of steel and yet I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.27,0:47:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他自从这件可怕的事发生后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he's hardly slept{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.94,0:47:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎没睡过觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since this terrible event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.82,0:47:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯有些事要告诉我们 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes has some news for us, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.36,0:47:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么好消息 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you to report, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.66,0:47:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前还没有弄清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purely negative as yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.27,0:47:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都调查过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have made inquiries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.21,0:47:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于任何有可能的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at every point where it might be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.77,0:47:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢肯定不必担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm sure there's no danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be apprehended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.00,0:47:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不够 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not enough, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.93,0:48:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能永远活在火山顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot live on this volcano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.70,0:48:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要把事情弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have something definite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.73,0:48:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得找到信还是很有希望的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have high hopes of getting the letters back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.13,0:48:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我在这里的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.80,0:48:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我越想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more I think of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.05,0:48:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the more I am convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.61,0:48:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这封信根本没离开过您家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the letter has never left this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.49,0:48:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh really, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.32,0:48:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是为什么会有人拿走文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why should anybody take it in order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.99,0:48:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是为了藏在家里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep it in this house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.83,0:48:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得有人拿走了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not convinced that anybody has taken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.23,0:48:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 这个玩笑可不合时宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, this joking is very ill timed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.79,0:48:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以肯定有人拿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my assurance it was taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.86,0:48:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从上个周二起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you examined the box carefully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.05,0:48:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细地检查过箱子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since last Tuesday morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.41,0:48:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No not thoroughly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.45,0:48:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得没有必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not consider it necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.48,0:48:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could conceivably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.84,0:48:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没看到那封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have overlooked the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.77,0:48:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不可能 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is impossible, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.03,0:48:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种事我见多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have known such things happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.11,0:48:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的箱子里还有别的文件吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have other papers in the box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.16,0:48:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 所有我的私密文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, all my confidential papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.93,0:48:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能和别的浑在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could have got mixed with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.97,0:48:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那封信在最顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was on the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.81,0:48:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}箱子可能被摇晃过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The box could have been shaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.85,0:48:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都摆好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had everything out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.10,0:48:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很容易整理的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easily settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.88,0:48:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咱们去看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go and look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.22,0:48:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这绝对是在浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a farcical waste of time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.18,0:48:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but still, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.85,0:48:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果没有什么别的事能让你满意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if nothing else will satisfy you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.52,0:48:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就去看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it shall be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.97,0:49:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是我的私密文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are all my confidential papers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.06,0:49:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.61,0:49:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是梅罗爵士的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a letter from Lord Merrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.53,0:49:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理斯·哈迪伯爵的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}report from Sir Charles Hardy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.41,0:49:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝尔格雷地的备忘录 这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}memorandum from Belgrade, that's the one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.18,0:49:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们今早在讨论的文件 首相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were discussing this morning, Prime Minister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.00,0:49:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}俄国和德国的粮食税记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}note on the Russo-German grain taxes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马德里的来信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}letter from Madrid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.07,0:49:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗拉沃爵士的记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}note from Lord Flowers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.91,0:49:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 就是它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.48,0:49:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信完好无损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the letter is intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.03,0:49:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太神奇了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.18,0:49:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is inconceivable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.05,0:49:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.72,0:49:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道它在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know it was here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.36,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道不在别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I knew it was nowhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.28,0:50:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot believe my eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.78,0:50:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希尔达 我们找到信了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilda, we have found the letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.87,0:50:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I know it is difficult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.43,0:50:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很难理解这种事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you to understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.48,0:50:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是最好的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it is the most wonderful news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常不同寻常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.47,0:50:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把每个文件都翻过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went through every paper in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.35,0:50:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我检查又检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked and I rechecked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.54,0:50:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可思议 它就在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's incomprehensible that I should have overlooked it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.62,0:50:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我竟然没看到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.73,0:50:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.61,0:50:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, {\r}
